.TH SAMPA2 1 "2026" "sampa2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sampa2 \- native GPU terminal emulator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sampa2
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sampa2
is a Rust\-only graphical terminal for Linux, rendered with winit + wgpu +
cosmic\-text over an alacritty_terminal VT engine \(em a single self\-contained
binary with no webview runtime.
.PP
It adds an in\-app command palette, a live man\-page panel, a safe
preview\-as\-you\-type pane, and an opt\-in Claude command suggester.
.SH KEY BINDINGS
Defaults (all overridable in the config's \fB[keybindings]\fR table):
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+T / W
New tab / close tab
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+P
Command palette
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+M
Man\-page panel for the current command
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+E
Toggle the command preview
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+A
Ask AI (opt\-in Claude command suggester; requires \fB[ai] enabled = true\fR and
\fB$ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\fR)
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+F
Find in the terminal
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+?
This shortcut list
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/sampa2/config.toml
Per\-user configuration (font, colors, keybindings, features, \fB[ai]\fR).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
Read at launch for the opt\-in command suggester; never stored by the app.
.SH SEE ALSO
Project: https://github.com/mpbarbosa/sampa2_graphics_terminal
